{"kind":"propose","text":"PB-3 can use the recorded observation acquisition shape for initial and renewed sessions and share the Reads cache. Reads.forget currently deletes a cache entry without notifying an already-open stream, and Reads.session collapses missing membership and other refusal to null. I propose the live watch’s injected supplier returns either `{ok:true,session,invalidated:Expiry}` or `{ok:false,reason}` using the recorded typed refusal vocabulary. The supplier’s owner aborts invalidated on replacement, forget or sign-out. The watch closes that reader immediately and refreshes through the shared acquisition, and also schedules expiry from the claims. That keeps the recorded observe owners stable, distinguishes the requested failure states, and prevents an idle stream hiding invalidation. The watch, enter, update and leave are in progress. Renewal source waits for LL-1."}